  tenTranh: "Tranh D\xE2n Gian \u0110\xF4ng H\u1ED3 H\u1ED9i K\xE9o Co"
  moTa: "Tranh \u0110\xF4ng H\u1ED3 H\u1ED9i K\xE9o Co th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n tr\xF2
    ch\u01A1i k\xE9o co ph\u1ED5 bi\u1EBFn trong v\u0103n h\xF3a d\xE2n gian Vi\u1EC7t
    Nam. Tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i n\xE0y kh\xF4ng ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u01A1n thu\u1EA7n l\xE0
    m\u1ED9t tr\xF2 gi\u1EA3i tr\xED, m\xE0 c\xF2n mang \xFD ngh\u0129a \u0111\xE0o
    t\u1EA1o v\xE0 r\xE8n luy\u1EC7n s\u1EE9c kh\u1ECFe, s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh c\u1EA3
    v\u1EC1 th\u1EC3 ch\u1EA5t l\u1EABn tinh th\u1EA7n cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i.
    B\xEAn c\u1EA1nh \u0111\xF3, tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i k\xE9o co c\xF2n gi\xFAp r\xE8n
    luy\u1EC7n s\u1EF1 g\u1EAFn k\u1EBFt v\xE0 s\u1EF1 ph\u1ED1i h\u1EE3p t\u1ED1t
    trong nh\xF3m."
